            <ArticleTitle>[From the physiology of pain to an antihyperalgesic nutritional approach].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>18-20</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pain is brought into play by a system which detects and transmits messages signaling pain. Opioids negatively modulate nociception, but paradoxically also contribute to hyperalgesia. A nutritional approach with low polyamine contents helps to reduce this phenomenon without the harmful side effects of antihyperalgesic drugs.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
